                "status"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Administrator JWT required (`role=admin`). Only {\"status\":\"approved\"}, {\"status\":\"rejected\"}, or {\"status\":\"resolved\"} are accepted. Allowed transitions: pending -> approved/rejected; approved -> rejected/resolved. Rejected and resolved are terminal. `pending` or `in_progress` in the request returns 422; an invalid transition returns 409. Community confirmations can also approve pending incidents. Approval records an event for future notifications but does not send Web Push."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "2 implemented admin endpoints: a status-filtered queue and one status transition endpoint."
